                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y3Bcf",
                  "name": "Section Description",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 760,
                  "content": "Equal pill segments, filled up to the current step. Stepper is bars only; Stepper/Labeled names each step so a finished step can be reopened. Segments use $accent when done or current and $accent-subtle-hover when upcoming; done steps keep their number in a muted tone.",
